{domain:2, official:false, fromCourse:true, q:`You have a personal skill named "code-review" in ~/.claude/skills. You clone a repository that also defines a project skill named "code-review" in .claude/skills. With no enterprise skill involved, which one does Claude Code use?`, options:[
