{domain:4, official:false, fromCourse:true, q:`You're building a retrieval pipeline over a collection of well-formatted markdown documents with consistent headers, versus a separate collection of messy, unstructured plain-text logs. What chunking approach best fits each?`, options:[
`Use semantic-based chunking for both collections entirely, since it is always superior regardless of document structure.`,
