`Skip MCP and have Claude Code call the Jira REST API directly through Bash with curl commands.`,
`Fork the community server and maintain a private custom build, combining control with a head start.`], correct:0, rationale:`For standard integrations, choosing existing community MCP servers over custom implementations is the recommended pattern; custom development is justified only for team-specific workflows. Bash+curl loses typed tool interfaces and structured error semantics; a private fork inherits all maintenance cost anyway.`},
{domain:1, official:false, multi:true, q:`An agent with analyze_content and analyze_document tools keeps routing web-page analysis to the wrong tool, despite both tools working correctly. Which TWO changes are the recommended fixes for this misrouting?`, options:[
`Rename the misused tool to a purpose-specific name (e.g., extract_web_results) and rewrite its description to state exactly when to use it versus its sibling.`,
