`Add a CLAUDE.md instruction stating "always use the MCP search server for every search task."`,
`Lower the MCP server's response latency, since the model deprioritizes slower tools automatically.`], correct:0, rationale:`The documented remedy is enhancing MCP tool descriptions so the agent can weigh them against built-ins. Removing Grep degrades tasks where literal text search is superior; a blanket "always use X" instruction is keyword-sensitive overcorrection; the model has no latency-based tool ranking.`},
{domain:3, official:false, q:`An extraction pipeline validates output and retries with error feedback. For one failure class — a missing warranty_expiration field — retries never succeed. Investigation shows the date appears only in a separate service manual that is not part of the input. What should you conclude?`, options:[
