`Keep all fields required so the model is forced to search the document more thoroughly before answering.`,
`Provide default values (0, "N/A") for the model to insert whenever extraction comes up empty.`], correct:[0,1], rationale:`Nullable fields and extensible enums ("other" + detail, "unclear") both give the model an honest escape hatch instead of structurally forcing fabrication. Required fields cause invented values; model-inserted defaults are indistinguishable from real extractions downstream.`},
{domain:4, official:false, q:`Your extraction system reports 97% overall accuracy, and leadership wants to drop human review for high-confidence outputs. What should you verify before agreeing?`, options:[
`That accuracy holds when broken down by document type and by field — aggregate metrics can mask poor performance on specific segments.`,
